Spleen 8x16 2.2.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Author:   Frédéric Cambus
Source:   https://github.com/fcambus/spleen
Licence:  BSD 2-Clause

Used for: the glyphs in rasterised frames, which is the text in the GIF
export. The bitmaps are generated from the release's spleen-8x16.bdf into
src/render/font/spleen8x16.ts by scripts/build-font.ts. The few glyphs Spleen
lacks are our own drawings, in src/render/font/extra.ts.

